flowchart TD
    Docs[Value rules + audit rules + approved memory + gold] --> Split[Semantic chunks + overlap + parent metadata]
    Split --> Embed[Embedding provider]
    Embed --> Milvus[Milvus vectors]
    Split --> SQL[PostgreSQL raw text + metadata]
    Query[Country + visual facts query] --> BM25[BM25 recall]
    Query --> Vector[Vector recall]
    BM25 --> Merge[Candidate pool + parent merge]
    Vector --> Merge
    Merge --> Rerank[Qwen rerank]
    Rerank --> Gate[Relevance gate + Top3 citations]
    Gate --> Answer[Grounded LLM answer + trace]
